            <note corresp="#d424-f1" n="1" xml:id="d424-f1-content">
                <p>For text of the resolution, see <ref target="frus1917Supp02v01#pg_420">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1917, Supplement 2, vol. I,
                        pp. 420</ref>–<ref target="frus1917Supp02v01#pg_423">423</ref>.</p>
